WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.880
<i>You have zero control over the ocean.</i>

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.680
<i>The only thing that you have control over</i>

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.720
<i>is your attitude and your actions.</i>

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:20.480 line:1%
In the United States, current rate is 22
veterans kill themselves every 24 hours.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.480
<i>I went to Iraq, and I came back
a completely different person.</i>

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.520
<i>You start thinking
about the firefights you've been in,</i>

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.000
the dead bodies you've seen.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.200
Excuse me.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.320
<i>I've been on just about
every drug on the market.</i>

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.840
I figured I'd be okay with dying.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.120
<i>Surfing, that was the biggest thing
on my bucket list.</i>

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.840
<i>I was gonna go surfing, go home,
and commit suicide.</i>

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:04.040
<i>When I caught that wave,
it wasn't death and destruction and hell.</i>

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>The ocean is the one place
I can go to for peace.</i>

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:13.760
I started Operation Surf
to take a group of veterans surfing.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.320
<i>It became clear to me what my purpose was.</i>

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.240
<i>It's rough, okay?</i>

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.480
-Don't give up.
-No.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.800
<i>Surfing is medicine.</i>

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:29.200
It helps them describe themselves
with a new story.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>It not only changed my life,</i>

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.360
but it saved my life.

